# API rules

- This app is the only source of truth for units, reservations, and availability.
- Enforce reservation overlap checks on the server, not only in clients.
- Reservation `source` values: `manual` | `website` | `booking_com` | `airbnb` | `agoda`.
- Model inventory as unique units with per-unit calendars.
- iCal sync refreshes PMS data; it does not remotely refresh OTAs.
- No OTA extranet scraping; no Channel Manager unless Phase 3 is explicitly started.
- Keep auth/roles (admin, front desk) on protected routes.
- Prefer modular domains: auth, units, reservations, ops, ingest, ical.
- Also read `apps/api/AGENTS.md` when working here.
